{"id":"647759","name":"面条菜拌竹荪","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/647759/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面条菜","amount":"100g"},{"name":"竹荪","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"大蒜","amount":"几颗"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"1g"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"1g"},{"name":"鸭梨醋","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"竹荪泡好。","img":"images/647759/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷水下锅焯水。","img":"images/647759/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"竹荪焯水的时候把面条菜洗净。","img":"images/647759/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"竹荪开锅煮3分钟，捞出过冷水沥干水分备用。","img":"images/647759/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放面条菜焯水。","img":"images/647759/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"开锅即可捞出过冷水撰干水分。","img":"images/647759/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"竹荪和面条菜放一起。","img":"images/647759/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大蒜切末。","img":"images/647759/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/647759/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/647759/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放鸭梨醋拌匀。","img":"images/647759/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放菜里。","img":"images/647759/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/647759/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/647759/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}